# Live guild records — rosters keyed by account id, bank contents, purchased
# buffs. Player data, not authored content (unlike guild-buffs/, which IS
# authored and is committed), so it must never be committed.
#
# The folder and guilds.json are recreated automatically on server start
# (see createGuildStore in server/guilds.js), so nothing is lost by ignoring
# them.
guilds.json
guilds.json.bak
